        "valueString": "Emergency department diagnosis documented superficial corneal foreign body with abrasion, without evidence of penetrating injury or open globe, and no endophthalmitis at that assessment. Ophthalmology documented low suspicion of penetrating injury; CT/X-ray was not indicated."
